# Software industry mapping for SRV
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/srv/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:application_compute_host owl:equivalentClass sw:ApplicationComputeHost .
legacy:application_compute_host_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:applicationComputeHostId .
legacy:hosts_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:hostsProductEdition .
